      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后，让即将到来的『日本德比』，\n成为史上最光辉灿烂的一战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbacd4f1130e5243547ee8e0d6fb93088f09fcef25f3d52a0acd72bded159eee",
