      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是啊。从今往后，我们也继续前进吧。\n携手并肩，一同迈步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3240d0dd7df6aa6b5e0e9fab8c13cd054b46e93d0bbec1886da9bae9d0cef347",
