      "uid": "zhcn:f3c9ab16b7108396267f96eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "相互提升，一同闪耀――\n“同期之轮”越是朝着未来迈步，\n就越是孕育出新的希望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9aec506db79e5ef7450e0244102a64600b3881afac83285db74eefd85a9dd0b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fb256fc9e8479d0f87d19cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当她提出想要维系这个联系时，\n我未曾想过竟能生出如此切实的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fef92d2cb28d29de1880df81418297d1051dcf64082f0718f4e004aefe4c4672",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9187fc9906c84e7f39ccc378",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比萨胜驹她……\n当时究竟是怀揣着怎样的远见\n才道出这个梦想的呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0bfd249125428dbbe8790ab60eedf55cac3cb13cde0228701399bae33ddc829",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
